+Feature: Todo Management
+  As a user
+  I want to manage a todo list
+  So that I can keep track of tasks I need to do
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Rule: No todos display
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer are hidden when there are no todos
+    Given there are no todos
+    Then "#main" is not visible
+    And "#footer" is not visible
+
+  Rule: Creating new todos
+
+  Scenario: Creating a new todo
+    Given the new todo input is focused
+    When I type "Buy groceries" into the new todo input
+    And I press Enter
+    Then a new todo "Buy groceries" appears in the list
+    And the new todo input is cleared
+
+  Scenario: Trimming whitespace from new todo
+    When I type "   Walk the dog   " into the new todo input
+    And I press Enter
+    Then a new todo "Walk the dog" appears in the list
+
+  Scenario: Ignoring empty input
+    When I type "" into the new todo input
+    And I press Enter
+    Then no new todo is created
+
+  Rule: Marking todos as complete
+
+  Scenario: Toggling a todo as completed
+    Given a todo "Buy groceries" exists
+    When I click the checkbox for "Buy groceries"
+    Then "Buy groceries" is marked as completed
+    And the "completed" class is added to its <li>
+
+  Scenario: Toggling a todo back to active
+    Given a todo "Buy groceries" that is completed
+    When I click the checkbox for "Buy groceries"
+    Then "Buy groceries" is marked as active
+
+  Rule: Marking all todos as complete
+
+  Scenario: Marking all todos as complete
+    Given todos "Buy groceries", "Walk the dog", "Do laundry" exist
+    When I click the "Mark all as complete" toggle
+    Then all todos are marked as completed
+    And the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all reflects single-item state
+    Given todos "Buy groceries", "Walk the dog" exist
+    When I click the checkbox for "Buy groceries"
+    And I click the checkbox for "Walk the dog"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed resets toggle-all
+    Given todos "Buy groceries", "Walk the dog" exist
+    When I click the checkbox for "Buy groceries"
+    And I click "Clear completed"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
+
+  Rule: Editing todos
+
+  Scenario: Double-clicking a todo enters edit mode
+    Given a todo "Buy groceries" exists
+    When I double-click the label of "Buy groceries"
+    Then the edit input for "Buy groceries" is shown
+    And the "editing" class is added to its <li>
+    And the edit input is focused
+
+  Scenario: Saving an edit on blur
+    Given I am editing "Buy groceries"
+    When I change the value to "Buy organic groceries"
+    And the edit input loses focus
+    Then the todo is updated to "Buy organic groceries"
+    And the "editing" class is removed
+
+  Scenario: Saving an edit on Enter
+    Given I am editing "Buy groceries"
+    When I change the value to "Buy organic groceries"
+    And I press Enter in the edit input
+    Then the todo is updated to "Buy organic groceries"
+    And the "editing" class is removed
+
+  Scenario: Destroying a todo when edit is empty
+    Given I am editing "Buy groceries"
+    When I clear the edit input
+    And I press Enter in the edit input
+    Then the todo "Buy groceries" is removed
+
+  Scenario: Discarding edits on Escape
+    Given I am editing "Buy groceries"
+    When I change the value to "Buy organic groceries"
+    And I press Escape in the edit input
+    Then the todo is still "Buy groceries"
+    And the "editing" class is removed
+
+  Rule: Deleting todos
+
+  Scenario: Deleting a todo
+    Given a todo "Buy groceries" exists
+    When I click the destroy button for "Buy groceries"
+    Then the todo "Buy groceries" is removed
+
+  Rule: Todo counter
+
+  Scenario: Displaying the active todo count
+    Given todos "Buy groceries", "Walk the dog", "Do laundry" exist
+    When I click the checkbox for "Walk the dog"
+    Then the todo count shows "2" items left
+
+  Scenario: Pluralizing the counter
+    Given a todo "Buy groceries" exists
+    Then the todo count shows "1" item left
+
+  Scenario: Zero items left
+    Given a todo "Buy groceries" exists
+    When I click the checkbox for "Buy groceries"
+    Then the todo count shows "0" items left
+
+  Rule: Clear completed button
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes completed todos
+    Given todos "Buy groceries", "Walk the dog" exist
+    When I click the checkbox for "Buy groceries"
+    And I click "Clear completed"
+    Then the todo "Buy groceries" is removed
+    And the todo "Walk the dog" remains
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed is hidden when no completed todos
+    Given a todo "Buy groceries" exists
+    Then the "Clear completed" button is not visible
+
+  Rule: Persistence
+
+  Scenario: Todos are persisted to localStorage
+    Given a todo "Buy groceries" exists
+    When I reload the app
+    Then the todo "Buy groceries" appears in the list
+
+  Scenario: Completed state is persisted
+    Given a todo "Buy groceries" that is completed
+    When I reload the app
+    Then "Buy groceries" is marked as completed
+
+  Scenario: Editing mode is not persisted
+    Given I am editing "Buy groceries"
+    When I reload the app
+    Then the todo "Buy groceries" is not in edit mode
